{
  "_doc": "ui-spec page id → v4 route (same contract as consoles/src/aws/services/*/spec-map.json). Fixtures/live hooks are consoles/src/azure/services/dns/fixtures.mjs. No honest_page entries — every gap is declared per-section via NotSimulatedContainer/CapabilityContainer instead.",
